        "subheading": "",
        "text_content": "<p>A circle within a circle, vast without, still within. This bracelet speaks of protection, wholeness, and the quiet assurance of peace and joy. Bamboo itself, ever resilient and upright, embodies the strength to bend without breaking — a reminder to walk through life with grace and steadiness. At the center lies a luminous stone: by day, a source of clarity and inspiration; by night, a gentle light that guides the way. Together with sandalwood’s grounding energy, this bracelet becomes a talisman of stability and balance — a quiet anchor for those who travel</p>",
