        "heading": "our story",
        "subheading": "",
        "text_content": "<p>AlmaZen is a lifestyle brand dedicated for spiritual growth and meaningful craftsmanship with heritage. </p><p>AlmaZen is rooted in the Chinese concept of Zen/Chan - a deep, meaningful connection built over time with body, mind, and nature. </p><p>Our founders started their spiritual journey together and eventually found solace in Zen (Chan) Buddhism and mediation, start your own journey today and explore Zen in life at this moment,right now. </p>",
        "button_label": "Read More",
        "button_aria_label": "",
        "button_url": "/pages/about-us#story",
