        "value_card_PDXnrH",
        "image_ccfCi9",
        "image_3rzjAf"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Brand Story",
      "settings": {
        "section_title": "Brand Story",
        "story_paragraph_1": "<p>AlmaZen is a spiritual lifestyle brand and community dedicated to bring mindfulness and wellness to our customers through Chinese Zen heritage. Our brand philosophy is deeply rooted in Zen, nurturing a mindful and meaningful connection with body, mind, and nature for you is our calling.</p>",
        "story_paragraph_2": "<p>Zen is infused in every aspect of AlmaZen products, every piece we offer is carefully handcrafted and then blessed in sacred temples, to bring the best energy for you.</p>",
        "story_paragraph_3": "<p>In today's fast-paced world, we believe everyone deserves a sanctuary of peace. Through the timeless wisdom of Zen tradition, we seamlessly blend classical elegance with modern functionality, creating not just products, but a way of life that embodies tranquility and mindfulness.</p>"
      }
    },
